    ["Each basic attack from a [Fog Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack(s) of [Moss Shadow Absorption], with each stack granting <HighLight>3%</> Life Steal and <HighLight>2%</> Max Health, stacking up to <HighLight>6</> times; gain <HighLight>1</> random Fog Forest Kin piece(s) after each player combat."] = "Each Базовая атака from a [Fog Forest Kin] piece grants <HighLight>1</> stack(s) of [Moss Shadow Absorption], with each stack granting <HighLight>3%</> Вампиризм and <HighLight>2%</> Max Health, stacking up to <HighLight>6</> times; gain <HighLight>1</> random Fog Forest Kin piece(s) after each player combat.",
